summary: Prepare the environment for testing

description: |
    Prepare the guest environment before running tests, for example
    by installing packages, running shell scripts or applying Ansible
    playbooks. See the :ref:`/plugins/prepare` documentation for
    available methods and supported options.

example: |
    prepare:
        how: install
        package: [httpd, curl]

link:
    - implemented-by: /tmt/steps/prepare
    - verified-by: /tests/prepare
